<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Luyana Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">MALOMA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Eliñolo lya Paulusi ku Maloma</para>
  <para style="toc2">Maloma</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlm</para>
  <para style="mt2">ELIN̄OLO LYA PAULUSI KU</para>
  <para style="mt1">MALOMA</para>
  <para style="imt">OKULIMUKISA</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Maloma kama ina kuñoliwa mwendi kwa mutumiwa Paulusi enako na kunyima mukaci no myaka makumi atanu ni ilimo inee ni makumi atanu ni ilimo itanu ni yaatu (54-58) munyima no kuleiwa kwa Jesu Kilesite. Paulusi yo kasipotela kale ku Loma sebeli otuma eliñolo eli, oku taluseta alapeli eyi no kutenda mu Loma, onje Amajuda nawo kaasa Majuda. Kame ana kuñola eli liñolo oku tundelela mu Kolinte oko ana kwikalanga ba nako eyo. Paulusi na kuñola nji cwale etinaha mu litunga lyonje atwese oku lumela ni ku kuteka Jesu Kilesite (16.26.)</para>
  <para style="ip">Ebuka no Maloma ni buka eyo ikwite outokwa onene kwaa sikulapela konje-konje mane ni mu nako yonje mulibaka omo iyupahalela nomo Paulusi atolokela wino-wino oku yoyisiwa satuwane mwa Jesu Kilesite. Paulusi kame ana kuwaneka eliywi no kuwaba lya Jesu Kilesite ku Testamente no kale. Asi ku kwiyeta no kupula kame akanana nji ekauhanyo noutokwa onene mubuka eyi ni (1.16) eyo yaamba nji, “Senisiwa mulibaka no eliywi no kuwaba, kakuli ni maata a Nyambe ba ku yoyisiwa kwaao alumela onje. Oweli ku Majuda, cwale kwaa no macaba.” Ekalulo no matatekelo no Maloma (1-11) ni yao asi ku kwiyeta mane ni kalulo no wili (12-15) kama ikwite eyi no kutenda eyino titaelo no kupula ku kuyoya kwao asi kulapela.</para>
  <para style="io">Emitwi no yambo</para>
  <para style="io">Paulusi kame atateka eliñolo lyaye abo mu ukulimukisa yonyene mane ni kwamba kwa woyo ana liñolele. (1.1-15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Aka no wiili kama añola eyi no mwikalelo no munu mane ni kutwesahala no ku yoyisiwa mwa Jesu Kilesite (1.16-11; 36).</para>
  <para style="io1">Munyima nweyi, Paulusi sebeli oba etitaelo no kutenda no kupula ku kuyoya no asiku lapela. (13.1-15; 13).</para>
  <para style="io">Kame amana eliñolo no Maloma mukuba etitumeliso no kupula kwaanu mu keleke na ku Loma (16).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1"/>Mene Paulusi, omubika wa Jesu Kilesite ona isaniwa oku tendiwa omutumwa nji aambe eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2"/>Eliywi no kuwaba ana kusepisa kale Nyambe mwanuhi aye mu man̄olo no kukena. <verse eid="ROM 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3"/>Eliywi no kuwaba okukumanena kwa mwanaye, ona kuleiwa mu lusika lwa Dabida mu lutu no unu, <verse eid="ROM 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:4"/>cwale naku monahalisiwa ni maata nji Mwanaa Nyanbe luli okukumanena ku mebo no kukena aba ana kwingulwa kwaafu, Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu. <verse eid="ROM 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5"/>Mwayonyene Jesu, Nyambe na kutuba esishemo no kutendiwa omutumiwa nji mulitina lyaye tu monise ano macaba etuso no ku kuteka. <verse eid="ROM 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6"/>Cwale okwekeza naanyi munaisaniwa kwa Nyambe nji mwikale kwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ROM 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7"/>Kwaanyi moonje aasikupumena muli mu Loma anyi musingiwa ni kwiisaniwa kwa Nyambe nji mutende esicaba saye.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:7">Mubiwe esishemo ni kozo kwa Nyambe Sitetu ni kwa Mbumu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etapelo no Kuba esi no Kutumela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8"/>Kame ni tateka oukutumela kwa Nyambe wange mwa Jesu Kilesite mulibaka lyenu moonje, kakuli etumelo yenu kame yambiwa mu litunga lyonje. <verse eid="ROM 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9"/>Kakuli Nyambe ni paki wange woyo ni belekela ni mebo yange mu liywi no kuwaba lya Mwanaye nji ni lesele oku mipuluka, <verse eid="ROM 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10"/>enako yonje abani lapela, kame ni kumbela nji mukusinga kwaye Nyambe alukise einu yonje nji ni lukisetwe omusipili no kuwaba aba niiya kwaanyi. <verse eid="ROM 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11"/>Kakuli kame nilakaza onene oku mimona, nji ni mibe empo imweya no mebo no kukena nji ni shukelwa <verse eid="ROM 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12"/>abo cwale kame tufanena oukususuweza toonje omunjili ku munjili mu tumelo yetu.<verse eid="ROM 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13"/>Anyi abange kame ni singa nji mulimuke, etinako no kupula kame ni singanga okwiiya mu ku mi mona kono kameni kwangwanga, kakuli kame kwiyanga indina eyi ini kwangwisanga. Kame ni naasingi nji niiye mu ku yangula etimbuto mwaanyi kanyi omo nina tendele kwa simacaba anjili. <verse eid="ROM 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14"/>Kakuli kame nili ni sikoloti ku Mageleke ni kwasi mishobo indina onje, bamweya kwasiku shangama naaelo. <verse eid="ROM 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15"/>Cwale kame ni shukelaoka kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe ni kwaanyi kame muyoya mu Loma.<verse eid="ROM 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaata no Liywi no Kuwaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16"/>Kakuli seene oku kutaza eliywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe, kono ni maata a Nyambe no kuyoyisa onje awo asi ku pumena, oweli ku Majuda okubinda okuta ku Mangelike <verse eid="ROM 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17"/>Kakuli mwasonyene okuluka kwa Nyambe kame kuna shootolwa, oku tunda ku tumelo ni kuta ku tumelo kanyi omo ku ng'olelwe nji, “Woyo no kuluka, mbayoyo mu tumelo yaye.”<verse eid="ROM 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omubonda no Masika no aanu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18"/>Kakuli okutweba kwa Nyambe kame kutundelela kuwilu, mi okulwisa ouyi ni ufokoli onje no alume awo ana lyatelele eniti mutikezo too no kwiiba. <verse eid="ROM 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19"/>Kakuli eso sitwesahala oku limukiwa sa Nyambe kame sina hupulelwa kwa onyene, kakuli Nyambe naimonahaza kwa onyene. <verse eid="ROM 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20"/>Kakuli oku tunda ku simuluho no litunga eyi ya Nyambe no kwamoniwa, amaata aye ni Unyambe waye kame imonahala wino-wino mu inu yaye ana tende. Cwale abakulingeso kakwisa omo sakutatulele. <verse eid="ROM 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21"/>Kakuli simba nji kame alimukile Nyambe, kaasimukuteka kanyi yokame Nyambe simba okutumela kwa yonyene, kono kame ana futuka aa nambulwa tuso mu mihupulo yoo ni micima yoo eyi isaela oku yupisisa sebeli iilola. <verse eid="ROM 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22"/>Kame ana singi nji atende anoku shangama, cwale sebeli afutuka aaelo, <verse eid="ROM 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23"/>ni kufutula ekanya ya Nyambe na kwaafa okwitenda amaswaniso no kuumba kanyi omunu, simba otuyunyi simba eiyamana, simba eyi yeenda ni mapumo.<verse eid="ROM 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24"/>Cwalehe, Nyambe naaleselele okutenda eyino titakazo no micima yoo na kwakena, nji ashubule etinyutu too mukaci koo. <verse eid="ROM 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25"/>Kakuli kame ana futula eniti ya Nyambe okwitenda amapwa ni kulapelela ni kusebeleza eyumbiwa okubita omuumbi, woyo olumbiwa enako yonje okuno kwabwa! Ameni<verse eid="ROM 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26"/>Mulibaka eli, Nyambe naaleselele okutwalelela mu titakazo too atenda eyi no kwiiba. Mane akati sebeli alangana ni akoo akati. <verse eid="ROM 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27"/>Mukutenda ngeso alume ni onyene sebeli alesela emikwa no kulangana naakati kono sebeli alangana nalume akoo.<verse eid="ROM 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28"/>Kakuli kasi tokomela oku limuka Nyambe woyo no niti, Nyambe naabi ku minahano na kwanahana wino. <verse eid="ROM 1:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29"/>Kame aiyalile eino kwiiba yonje mi kame ali ni matalu, ni lutimbo, mane kame ashukela eyi no akoo, ni muna nuukwibaa, ni tin̄ananyi ni tindwaa mane ni kooba <verse eid="ROM 1:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30"/>asimapwa, aa atimbile Nyambe, asi kunyefula, asi ku kuhumusa, asi kutateka eyi no kwiiba mi kakuteke ashemi oo. <verse eid="ROM 1:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31"/>Kaakwite etingana, kaasepahala, kaakwite elizwalo ni kuulwa amakeke. <verse eid="ROM 1:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32"/>Naaba alimukile ekatulo ya Nyambe eyi yaamba nji, Aanu onje ayoya ngeso, kame afanena okufa. Cwale kaitende fela, kono kame alumelela awo aitenda.<verse eid="ROM 1:32"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ekatulo ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1"/>Cwalehe weene omunu wakwite okulemena aakowe mi kame watula, kame okwatula wenyene. Kakuli wene watula kame otenda eyi atenda. <verse eid="ROM 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2"/>Tulimukile nji ekatulo ya Nyambe niya niti kwao atenda eyi no kwiiba. <verse eid="ROM 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3"/>Cwale wene omunu feela aba watula akowe, kono ni wene otenda eyi atenda, kame onahana nji mbupicuka ekatulo ya Nyambe? <verse eid="ROM 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4"/>Kamba nji kame oshwaula esifumu no sishemo saye, nu ukukuteka kwaye, ni mucima waye no kuwaba kono kulemuha nji esishemo sa Nyambe kame sikutwala kukubaka? <verse eid="ROM 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5"/>Kono mulibaka no kwaayupa kowe ni mucima wowe no kwabaka kame okutewela okutweba muliywa lya Nyambe abo cwale ekatulo yaye no kuluka aba saimonahale. <verse eid="ROM 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6"/>Kakuli Nyambe kame sabe omunu ni munu omupuzo okukumanena kweyo atenda. <verse eid="ROM 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7"/>Kwao atwalelela okutenda wino einu, okame awo asaela okuyemiwa, ni kukutekiwa na kwaafa, asabiwe omoyo na kwaabwa. <verse eid="ROM 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8"/>Kono kwao aku tendela eyoo ni kukana eniti yaye ni kutenda ouyi, kame sa tambule okutweba ni kutina kwaye. <verse eid="ROM 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9"/>Kame sakwikale amayando ni kukola kwaanu onje awo atenda eyi no kwiiba, oweli ku Majuda ni ku Mangelike <verse eid="ROM 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10"/>Kono Nyambe mbabi ekanya ni tumbo ni kozo ku munu yonje woyo otenda wino, oweli ku Majuda okubinda ku Mangelike <verse eid="ROM 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11"/>Kakuli kwa Nyambe kakwisa esaluluti.<verse eid="ROM 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12"/>Awo onje ana tende esibi nambulwa mulawo wa Mushe kame saatuliwe no mbulwa omulawo. Mi awo onje anatende esibi alimukile omulawo mbaatuliwa ku mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13"/>Abo kasa awo ayupa omulawo wa Mushe awo akenine balubala wa Nyambe, kono awo akokong'elela omulawo wa Mushe asa kayoyisiwe. <verse eid="ROM 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14"/>Cwale asimacaba aba kaakwite omulawo kono alemine okutenda eso sisaeliwa ku mulawo wa Mushe, ni onyene ni mulawo kwaonyene, simba kwakwite omulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15"/>Kame amonisa nji eso omulawo wa Mushe osaela kame sing'olilwe ku micima yoo, abo emihupulo yoo kono elizwalo lyoo kame lyaapakela mi emihupulo yoo kame yaanyaza abanjili kame yaimanenanga. <verse eid="ROM 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16"/>Ba liywaa elyo, okukumanena ni liywi lyange no kuwaba, Nyambe kame saatule etikunutu no aanu mwa Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amajuda ni Mulao wa Mushe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17"/>Cwale weene wisaniwa nji uli Mujuda kame oku sepisa ba mulawo wa Mushe mi kame oku lumba mwa Nyambe, <verse eid="ROM 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18"/>ni kulimuka etato yaye ni kwekeza okutenda wino kakuli kame ona iyetiwa mu mulawo wa Mushe, <verse eid="ROM 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19"/>mi kame olimukile nji yawene otwaletele eibofu, eliseli kwawo ali mu uwi, <verse eid="ROM 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20"/>tiwe omusiululi no aelo ni mwiyeti no awo ali mu uwi mu mulawo wa Mushe, kakuli kame okwite esisupo no kulimuka eniti. <verse eid="ROM 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21"/>Cwalehe, wene olemine okwiyeta akowe, ikene aba wasiku kwiyeta wenyene? Kame okutaza nji kakufanene okwiita, cwale ikene aba wiita? <verse eid="ROM 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22"/>Wene aba wamba nji kakufanene okutenda ouhule, cwale ikene aba utenda ouhule? Kame utimbile aafu no kuumba, cwale kame wiitanga mu tindoo no ku lapelela aafu <verse eid="ROM 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23"/>Wene kame oku nuneka bakwikala ni mulawo wa Nyambe, kono kame oshwaula Nyambe mukucola omulawo waye! <verse eid="ROM 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24"/>Kakuli kame ku ng'oliwa nji, “Elitina lya Nyambe kame linyefulwa mwa asimacaba mulibaka lyenu aendisi no Majuda.”<verse eid="ROM 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25"/>Omupato wowe ni waniti nji kame okuteka omulawo, kono nji kame ocola omulawo, omupato wowe kautendile mupato luli. <verse eid="ROM 2:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26"/>Cwalehe nji omunu no kwaingena mu mupato, kame ateula etitaelo no mulawo wa Mushe, kame kukufekile kanyi naingene mumu pato. <verse eid="ROM 2:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27"/>Cwale woyo nakwaingena mu mupato kono kame amamela omulawo kame sami atule anyi muna ng'olelwe eyi no mulawo ni mupato kono kame mucola omulawo. <verse eid="ROM 2:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28"/>Kakuli woyo na kwatenda Omujuda luli oli bandee, simba nji omupato no niti sinu sinjili sili bandee ni lutu <verse eid="ROM 2:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29"/>Omujuda luli woyo mukaci, mi omupato luli ni wa mu mucima owo otendiwa ni mebo kasa feela. Okulumbiwa kwaye kakutundu kwaanu kono kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 2:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1"/>Cwale ouwa ana wana aendisi no Majuda ubine? Simba etuso no mupato ibine? <verse eid="ROM 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2"/>Onene ku maneku onje! Mu ku tateka, Nyambe na ku sepa omusebezi waye ni kubeeka amaywi aye ku Majuda oweli. <verse eid="ROM 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3"/>Cwale ngasibine nji anjili kakwite etumelo? Ninji okuulwa koo etumelo kame kutwesa oku shwaula etumelo ya Nyambe? <verse eid="ROM 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4"/>Kokuulwa! Kasangeso, mulesele Nyambe no niti simba nji aanu onje ni amapwa. Kanyi omo kun̄olelwe mu man̄olo nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:4">“Kame ufanene oku monahala woyo no niti mu yambo wamba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:4">Nji ushowelele woyo nakukunungelela eyambo aba uzekisiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 3:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5"/>Kono cwale nji okufosa kwetu kame kumonahala okuluka kanyi kwa Nyambe, abohe iikene sa twaambe? Cwale mbatwamba nji Nyambe kame afosa aba alita okutweba kwaaci? (Kame naamba ngeso mu mukwa no unu.) <verse eid="ROM 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6"/>Kokuulwa! kakuli kambe Nyambe kasa wakuluka, kambe ngasibine saatwese okwatula elitunga?<verse eid="ROM 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7"/>Kono cwale nji okuulwa eniti kwange kame kutusa oku monisa wino eniti ya Nyambe, mane ni kwekeza ekanya yaye, iikene saniatulelwe kanyi osi ku tenda ouyi? <verse eid="ROM 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8"/>Cwale iikene aba twaatende eyi no kwiiba nji eyi no kuwaba iiye?” Kanyi aanu anjili aba aninyaza nji kame ni tenda ouyi! Oku nyaza koo na kuluku.<verse eid="ROM 3:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kakwisa Woyo no Kuluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9"/>Iikene cwale! Ninji aaci aendisi no Majuda kame tuli wino okubita ano Magelike? Kokulwa kasangeso! Kakuli kame inaamba kale nji aendisi no Majuda ni Magelike kame ali mu maata no sibi. <verse eid="ROM 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10"/>Kanyi aba kun̄olilwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 3:10">Kakwisa omunu simba mumweya uyu no kuluka.<verse eid="ROM 3:10"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11"/>Kakwisa uyu uyupisisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:11">simba uyu osaela Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 3:11"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12"/>Onje kame a yaukile, bamweya naafutuka aa no kwiiba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">mi naafoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:12">kakwisa uyu otenda esi nokuluka, simba mumweya.<verse eid="ROM 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13"/>Emilyu yoo ni libita liyamine,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 3:13">kameonga ni tindimi too, nimaywi nokwiiba kanyi esifanu no sibili, aatunda mutunwa too.<verse eid="ROM 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14"/>Mutunwa too kame kuiyalile etingangu, ni ikuto no kulula.<verse eid="ROM 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15"/>Amakondo oo nakuleluba ba kwiita ounyinga.<verse eid="ROM 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16"/>Mutindila too kame kuli oku sinya ni mayando.<verse eid="ROM 3:16"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17"/>Kaalimukile endila no kozo,<verse eid="ROM 3:17"/></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18"/>Mi mu miyo oo kaacili Nyambe.”<verse eid="ROM 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19"/>Cwale kame tulimukile wino nji eiyambiwa mu mulawo yonje kame yambeliwa aayoya munji no mulawo, nji otunwa tonje tondoke mi aanu onje awaniwe ni mubonda balubala wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20"/>Kakuli kakwisa omunu somoniwa nji niwakuluka mu miyo aye mu musebezi no mulawo, kakuli omulawo kame otulimukisa esibi.<verse eid="ROM 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omo tubeekelwe ouwa kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21"/>Kono cwale okutundisako omulawo okuluka kwa Nyambe naku limukisiwa, me upakiwa ku mulawo ni unuhi. <verse eid="ROM 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22"/>Okuluka kwa Nyambe kame kutundelela mutumelo mwa Jesu Kilesite kwao apumena onje, kakuli kakwisa efapahano mukaci koo. <verse eid="ROM 3:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23"/>Kakuli onje kame ana tende esibi mi kame ana kauhelwe ku kanya ya Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24"/>Mi kame ana beekiwa fela ano kuluka mu sishemo saye kanyi omupuzo mu kuliululiwa kwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ROM 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25"/>Woyo ona kubekiwa balubala kwa Nyambe okutenda esitabelo mulibaka no unyinga waye nji otambulwe mu tumelo. Esi kame sina kumonisa okuluka kwa Nyambe, naaba kasi kwaliketa ku ibi no kale. <verse eid="ROM 3:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:26"/>Neli oku monisa mu nako no balelo lino nji yonyene niwakuluka, ninji woyo oli ni tumelo mwa Jesu, Nyambe kame amubeeka ono kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27"/>Cwalehe, ikene satukulumbe nayo? Kakwisa! Mulibaka libine? Mulibaka no musebezi? Kokuulwa! Kono mulibaka no tumelo. <verse eid="ROM 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28"/>Kakuli kame tukolwa nji omunu kame abeekiwa ono kuluka mulibaka no tumelo kasa mu misebezi no mulawo. <verse eid="ROM 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29"/>Cwale Nyambe, ni Nyambe no Majuda feela nji? Kasa nji ni Nyambe no macaba? Ee, ni Nyambe waa no macaba nonyene. <verse eid="ROM 3:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30"/>Kaksuli Nyambe ni mumweya, mi aa ali ni mupato kame wabeeka ano kuluka mulibaka no tumelo yoo, nawo aulwile omupato ni mulibaka no tumelo yoo. <verse eid="ROM 3:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31"/>Cwale kame tucola omulawo mulibaka no tumelo? Kokulwa kasangeso, kono kame tongota omulawo.<verse eid="ROM 3:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4"/>
  <para style="s">Omwanda wa Abulahama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1"/>Cwale iikene satwambe, Abulahama njekulyetu, siikene ana kuwana kuneku no unu? <verse eid="ROM 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2"/>kakuli nji Abulahama kame na beekiwa wa kuluka mulibaka no misebezi, abo, kame ali neso sakulumbe naso. Kono kasa balubala wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3"/>Cwale eling'olo iikene lyamba? “Abulahama kame ana kupumena kwa Nyambe, mi okupumena kwaye, Nyambe kame amubalela nji wa kuluka.” <verse eid="ROM 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4"/>Cwale ku munu woyo otenda omusebezi, omupuzo waye kawaliketiwa nji ni mpo, kono ni tifo. <verse eid="ROM 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5"/>Cwale ku munu no kwa tenda omusebezi kono kame apumena fela kwa Nyambe, woyo oba aano kwiiba okubeekiwa ono kuluka, yonyene etumelo yaye kame ibaliwa nji kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6"/>Esi sokame Dabida esa aamba embuyoti no munu woyo waliketiwa kwa Nyambe nji ni wakuluka, oku ulwile emisebezi aba aamba nji,<verse eid="ROM 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7"/>“Kame ali ni mbuyoti awo ana lemenwa etifoso too,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 4:7">Awo ana fukeliwa eibi yoo!<verse eid="ROM 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8"/>Embuyoti ni ya munu woyo uulwa okupulukelwa eibi yaye kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9"/>Embuyoti eyo kana kame ibiwa feela aa anati ku mupato, nji naa kasita ku mupato? kakuli kame twamba nji, “Abulahama naku pumena kwa Nyambe mi mu tumelo yaye, Nyambe naku mu pumena nji wa kuluka.” <verse eid="ROM 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10"/>Cwale ngasibine aba ana kubalelwa ngeso, yoli ngaibi? Abo yowa ingena kale mu mupato, nji yokasi ingena kale? Neli abo yokasi ingena kale, kasa nji yowa ingena kale kokulwa. <verse eid="ROM 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11"/>Sebeli ota ku mupato, neli esisupo no kumonisa nji wakuluka mu tumelo yaye anakwikala nayo yokasita kale ku mupato. Elibaka neli nji atende Sitoo onje kwawo apumena kwa Nyambe onje, nawo aulwile okuta ku mupato nji nonyene abalelwe etumelo nji nikuluka. mi kame a tambulwa kwa yonyene kakuli ni wa kuluka, simba nji kaa sita ku mupato. <verse eid="ROM 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12"/>Kame osili Sitoo kwao a tambulwa kuta ku mupato, kasa kwao fela anati ku mupato, kono nawo aenda mu mwanda no tumelo ya Sitetu Abulahama yokasita kale ku mupato.<verse eid="ROM 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Esepiso ya Nyambe kame Itambulwa mu Tumelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13"/>Esepiso ya Abulahama na ikulyaye noku yola elitunga, kayasikwiiya mu mulawo kono neli mukuluka no tumelo. <verse eid="ROM 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14"/>Cwale nji okuyola kame kuyoliwa ni mulawo, ulimuke nji etumelo ni sepiso kaikwite tuso. <verse eid="ROM 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15"/>Kakuli omulawo kame ulita okutweba, kono aba kuulwile omulawo kakutamba kwikala okucola omulawo. <verse eid="ROM 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16"/>Mulibaka no ngeso, esepiso kame ina kwiya mu tumelo, nji itende mu sishemo, nji yongotetwe mu lusika lwa Abulahama, kasa kwao fela asi mulawo kono ni kwao akwite etumelo ya Abulahama. Yo sitetu toonje, <verse eid="ROM 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17"/>kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe nji, “Kame inaku tende Sitoo no matunga no kupula.” Mu miyo a Nyambe, mwayonyene apumena, woyo oba omoyo kwaanokufa ni kwiisana einu nji kame iyoya eyo nokwayoya. <verse eid="ROM 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18"/>Abulahama sebeli opumena mukusepa, naba kuna kuulwa esepo, mi sebeli otenda ngeeso Sitoo nomacaba no kupula, kanyi omo kuna kwambelwa kwa yonyene nji, “Kanyi olusika lowe omo salwikalele. <verse eid="ROM 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19"/>Mi kakuli kasi kufokola mu tumelo, mane kasi kwaliketa nji olutu lwaye kame lukulubalile, kakuli emyaka yaye kame inakwana omwanda (100), ni kunahana nji moyo waye Sala katwese ku leya kame. <verse eid="ROM 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20"/>Kakuli kakwisa esinu simba simweya sinaku mutongokisanga okukumanena ni sepiso ya Nyambe, kono sebeli okongota mu tumelo yaye muku lumbeka Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21"/>Kame ana kolwa nji Nyambe mbatwese okutenda eso anaku musepisa. <verse eid="ROM 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22"/>Ababo etumelo yaye sebeli oibalelwa nji kuluka, <verse eid="ROM 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:23"/>kono amaywi anaku ng'olelwa kasa aye fela yomboci. <verse eid="ROM 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24"/>Kono naaci ngeso kame sabalelwe ni kwaaci tu pumena kwa woyo ona kwingulwa kwaafu Jesu Ombumu wetu. <verse eid="ROM 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25"/>Woyo ona kwibaiwa mulibaka no ibi yetu, ni kwingulwa nji tubekiwe ano kuluka.<verse eid="ROM 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5"/>
  <para style="s">Ouwa ni Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1"/>Cwale aba tuna tendiwa anokuluka mu tumelo, kame tuli mu kozo ni Nyambe mulibaka lya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ROM 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2"/>Mwa yonyene tunawana etumelo mu sishemo omo tuwaniwa, mi kame tuwabelelwa mu sepo no kanya ya Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3"/>Cwale kasa ngeso fela, kono kame tuwabelelwa mu mayando etu, kakuli kame tulimukile nji amayando kame atulitela okongoteta, <verse eid="ROM 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4"/>Okutundamena kame kulita emikwa no kuwaba mi emikwa no kuwaba kame ilita esepo. <verse eid="ROM 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5"/>mi esepo kaitwenisa, kakuli elilato lya Nyambe nali kwitelwa mu micima yetu, mu mebo no kukena, eyo ina kubiwa kwaaci.<verse eid="ROM 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6"/>Kakuli abo metu sifokola, ba nako inakufanena Kilesite nakufela asikutenda ouyi. <verse eid="ROM 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7"/>Iikene aba kubambabile nji omuunu afele aa nokuluka, mwendi omunjili abasa kongote omucima okufela aano kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8"/>Kono Nyambe kame amonisa elilato lyaye kwaaci nji nabo tusilemine okutenda eibi, kakuli Kilesite nakutufela! <verse eid="ROM 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9"/>Cwalehe abo, aba tubeekilwe anokuluka ni unyinga waye, mbatu yoisiwa mwa yonyene ku kutweba kutunda kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10"/>Kakuli naba tusili eiila, kame tuusetwa kwa Nyambe muibaka no lufu lwa Mwanaye, aba tuna usetwa kwa yonyene, kame satu yoisiwe onene mulibaka no moyo waye! <verse eid="ROM 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11"/>Kasangeso fela, kono tusi wabelelwa mwa Nyambe mulibaka lya Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu, kakuli aba tuna usiwa ngeso ni mulibaka lyaye.<verse eid="ROM 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elifu mwa Adama Oupilo mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12"/>Mulibakaelyo esibi nasikwiiya mu litunga mulibaka no munu mumweya mi elifu ni mulibaka no sibi, mu mukwanongeso elifu naliyi kwaanu onje kakuli kame anatende esibi onje. <verse eid="ROM 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13"/>Esibi luli kwasina kwikalanga oweeli mu litunga omulawo akawa sisumiwa kale, kono esibi kasi baliwa aba kuulwile omulawo. <verse eid="ROM 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14"/>Nabakulingeso elifu nali kubusa okutunda kwa Adama okutwala kwa Mushe, simba kwao ana kwatenda esibi kame liikalako noku matuka omulawo mu mukwa oku fekile kanyi anakutenda Adama,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 5:14">Yonyene oli esifekiso sa woyo soiya. <verse eid="ROM 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15"/>Kono empo no sishemo kaikufekile kanyi esibi sa Andama. Kakuli aano kupula kame anafu mulibaka no munu mumweya, esishemo sa Nyambe ni mpo itunda mu sishemo no munu mumweya yonyene Jesu Kilesite yonyene kame ipulele aano kupula niku bitelela! <verse eid="ROM 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16"/>Mi empo kai kufekile kanyi esibi sina kwiiya mulibaka no munu mumweya, kakuli ekatulo no munu mumweya kame ina liti ekatulo no kuba aanu no kupula omubonda, kono empo no sishemo kame inatundu ku tifoso no kupula mi kame ina bwele mu kututenda aa no kuluka! <verse eid="ROM 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17"/>Nji mulibaka no mubonda no munu mumweya elifu kame linabusu mulibaka lya woyo omunu mumweya, onene awo nambula esishemo mukupula kwaso, ni mpo no kutenda aa no kuluka, kame saabuse mu moyo mwa yonyene woyo mumweya Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18"/>Cwalehe, kanyi omubonda no munu mumweya aba ona liti ekatulo eyi iba aanu no kupla omubonda, mu mukwanongeso, okuluka no munu mumweya kame kulitela aanu onje okuluka oko kuba omoyo. <verse eid="ROM 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19"/>Mi kanyi aanu no kupula aba anabeekiwa asi kutenda esibi mulibka no kwaluka kwa munu mumweya, mu mukwanongeso mukuluka kwa munu mumweya aanu no kupula kame satendiwe aa no kuluka.<verse eid="ROM 5:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20"/>Omulawo nawiyi nji etifoso tipule, kono oko okupula no esibi, esishemo sa Nyambe kame sipula onene ni kubitelela. <verse eid="ROM 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21"/>Nji cwale esibi aba sina busu ni puso no lifu, mu mukwanngeso esishemo sibuse oku tutenda aa no kuluka, ni puso no omoyo no kwaabwa, mwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu.<verse eid="ROM 5:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6"/>
  <para style="s">Elifu kame litunda ku Sibi kono Okuyoya kame kwiiya mwa Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1"/>Cwale iikene satwambe? Cwale tusiekeza okuyoya mu sibi nji esishemo simonahale mukupula. <verse eid="ROM 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2"/>Kokuulwa! Natukufa kulineku no sibi, cwale ngasibine satuyoye musibi? <verse eid="ROM 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3"/>Cwale kamulimukile nji aaci tonje tuna kolobezwa mwa Jesu Kilesite kame tuna kolobeziwa mu lifu lyaye? <verse eid="ROM 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4"/>Natu pumbekiwa cwale naye mu kolobezo no lifu, nji cwale abo Kilesite aba saingulwe kwaafu mu kanya ya Sitetu, naaci kame mba twende mu moyo no ubya.<verse eid="ROM 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5"/>Kakuli nji natu kuwana naye mukufa noku kufeka kanyi kwaye, mbatu kuwana naye mukwinguka kwaye. <verse eid="ROM 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6"/>Cwale tulimukile nji ounu wetu no kale kame una kwiibaiwa ni yonyene, nji cwale olutu no sibi lubwe nji tulese okutenda aabika no sibi kame. <verse eid="ROM 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7"/>Kakuli nji omunu nafu kame alukuluhile mu sibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8"/>Nji natufi ni Kilesite kame tupumena nji mbatwinguka ni yonyene kame. <verse eid="ROM 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9"/>Kakuli kame tulimukile nji Kilesite abana kwinguka kwaafu katamba kufa kame, mi elifu kali tamba okwikala ni maata kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ROM 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10"/>Elifu anafu kame anafu kamweya ku sibi sonje, kono omoyo a yoya, kame ayoyela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 6:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11"/>Yongeso ni kwaanyi, muhupule nji namukufa ku sibi, mi kame muyoye kwa Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12"/>Esibi silese okubusa mu tinyutu tenu nokufa, mulese okuteteta ku titakazo no sibi. <verse eid="ROM 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13"/>Kame mulese okuba esibi kwilama no lutu lwenu nji itende kanyi eyitusiso no kutendisa eyi no kwiiba, kono mukubeeke kwa Nyambe kanyi awo ana tundisiwa ku lufu okuta mu upiplo, nikuba ekalulo no ilama yenu kwa Nyambe nji itende eitusiso no kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14"/>Kakuli esibi kasitamba oku tenda Ombumu wowe, kakuli kausamo munji no mulawo wa Mushe kono munji no sishemo.<verse eid="ROM 6:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aabika no Kuluka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15"/>Iikene, cwale? Kana mbatutende esibi kakuli kame tuli munji no mulawo wa Mushe kono kakuli kame tuli munji no sishemo? Kakukonahala! <verse eid="ROM 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16"/>Cwale kamulimukile nji aba mukutenda aabika no munu oku muyupa, kame muli aabika aye yonyene woyo muyupa, simba abika no sibi esi sitwala ku lifu, simba ku likute eli litwala ku kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17"/>Kono kame tukutumela kwa Nyambe simba nji kame tuli aabika no sibi kame muna kukuteka etuto eyo muna kubiwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18"/>Namu lukululwa ku sibi mi sebeli muli aabika kweyi no kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19"/>Kame naamba mu mukwa no ounu, mulibaka no kufokola mu ku yupisisa kwenu. Ba weeli namu kutenda aabika kweyi no kwiiba, oku yoya omoyo no kwiiba. Cwalehe mukutende aabika no kuluka nji mukenisiwe.<verse eid="ROM 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20"/>Aba muna kwikalanga aabika no sibi, namu kulukuluha kweyi no kuluka. <verse eid="ROM 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21"/>Cwalehe omupuzo muna kuwanabo munako eyo ubine ku inu eyo imyenisa bano? Einu eyo kame imitwala ku lufu! <verse eid="ROM 6:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22"/>Kono cwale namukulukululwa kusibi, sebeli muli aabika a Nyambe, mi omupuzo munawana kame umitwale ku kukena, mi amamaneneno ni moyo na kwaabwa. <verse eid="ROM 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23"/>Kakuli omupuzo no sibi nikufa, kono empo no sishemo sa Nyambe nikuyoya nokwabwa mulibaka lya Jesu Kilesite Ombumu weetu.<verse eid="ROM 6:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7"/>
  <para style="s">Omwanda no Likwala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1"/>Abange kamulimukile, kakuli kame naamba kwaawo alimukile omulawo nji omulawo kame obusa omunu abo yosiyoya. <verse eid="ROM 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2"/>Mulibakaelyo, omukati no ku kwala kame anungilwi kwa mbumwaye mulibaka no mulawo yosiyoya, kono nji mbumwaye nafu, na lukululwa ku mulawo owo umununga kwa mbumwaye, <verse eid="ROM 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3"/>cwale kame saisaniwe omubuki aba sakwale ku mulume mundina nji mbumwaye yosiyoya. kono nji mbumwaye nafu, na lukuluka ku mulawo owo, mi nji akwale ku mulume mundina kaisanwa nji mubuki. <verse eid="ROM 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4"/>Abange naanyi ngeso, namufu kulineku no mulawo mu lutu lwa Kilesite nji cwale mutende ano munjili, awoyo yonyene ona ingulwa kwaafu nji tubeekele Nyambe emiselo. <verse eid="ROM 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5"/>Kakuli abo tusiyoya mu nyama, etikezo tetu no kwiiba kame tina ku sebezanga mu ilama yetu, mi naiku litanga elifu. <verse eid="ROM 7:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6"/>Kono cwale, natu lukuluha ku mulawo, kakuli natufu ku onyene onakutu nunganga, nji tusebeleze Nyambe mu mukwa no ubya no mebo, kasa mu mukwa no kale no taku ina ng'oliwa.<verse eid="ROM 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulao wa Mushe ni sibi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7"/>Cwale iikene satwambe? nji omulawo ni sibi? Kokuulwa! Kono kwaulu omulawo kambe kanisi limuka esibi. Kwaulu omulawo waambe nji, “Olese oku lakaza,” kambe kanisi limuka oku lakaza. <verse eid="ROM 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8"/>Kono esibi nasiwana omukwa mi nasiingene mwa mene mukulaelwa, etitakazo tonje. Kakuli oko kuulwile omulawo, esibi nasifu. <verse eid="ROM 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9"/>Mene kame ina kuyoya okuulwile omulawo, kono etaelo aba ina kwiiya, esibi sebeli siinguka, mi mene sebeli nifa. <verse eid="ROM 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10"/>Etaelo inakuni sepisa omoyo, sebeli iwaniwa nji kame initwala ku lifu. <verse eid="ROM 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11"/>Kakuli esibi nasiwana esibaka oku nionga mu taelo, mi sebeli nifa mwa yonyene eyo etaelo.<verse eid="ROM 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12"/>Onyene omulawo niwakukena, niyonyene etaelo niyakukena, no kuluka, no kuwaaba. <verse eid="ROM 7:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13"/>Cwalehe, esinu no kuwaba nasiliti olufu kwa meme? Kokuulwa! neli esibi sina sebeze elifu kwa mene mu sinu esi no kuwaba nji simonahale nji ni sibi, nji mulibaka no taelo esibi nasi futuka esinu no kwiiba oku manenena onene luli.<verse eid="ROM 7:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Endwaa mukaci Ketu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14"/>Tulimukile nji omulawowa Mushe niwa mebo, kono mene kaniwa mebo, kame nina ulisiwa kanyi omubika no sibi. <verse eid="ROM 7:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15"/>Siyupisisa eso ni tenda, kakuli sitende eso ni saela, kono kame nitenda eso ni timbile. <verse eid="ROM 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16"/>Cwale nji ni tende eso ni ulwa okusinga, kame ni pumena nji omulawo niwa kuwaba. <verse eid="ROM 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17"/>Abo cwale kasa mene luli nitenda ngeeso, kono ni sibi eso sili mwa mene. <verse eid="ROM 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18"/>Kakuli kame nilimukile nji ouwa kausako mwa mene, mi mbili muunu feela, kakuli okusinga mwakuli mwa mene, kono sitwese okutenda ouwa. <verse eid="ROM 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19"/>Kakuli sitende ouwa ni singa, kono ouyi nitimbile wani twalelela oku tenda. <verse eid="ROM 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20"/>Cwale nji kame nitenda eyo nitimbile, kasa mene otenda ngeeso, kono ni sibi eso sili mwa mene.<verse eid="ROM 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21"/>Cwale kame niwana nji aba nisinga okutenda esino kuwaba, ouyi wokame oli kwa mene. <verse eid="ROM 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22"/>Kame ni lakaza omulawo wa Nyambe mu munu woyo oli mukaci no mucima wange. <verse eid="ROM 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23"/>Kono kameni mwine omulawo wa Mushe mundina mu ilama yange owo ukulwisa ni mulawo no ku yupisisa kwange, mi kame unitwala mu ubika no mulawo no sibi owo oli mu ilama yange. <verse eid="ROM 7:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24"/>Mbili munu no umayi no ngasibine? anyine soni tundisa mu lutu luno lunitwa ku lifu? <verse eid="ROM 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25"/>Kame niku tumela kwa Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Cwale simba mene, kame ni sebeleza omulawo wa Nyambe muku yupisisa kwange, kono mu nyama kame ni sebeleza omulawo no sibi.<verse eid="ROM 7:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8"/>
  <para style="s">Oupilo mu mebo no kukena</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1"/>Kakwisa katulo cwale kwaa aikalile kwa Jesu Kilesite. <verse eid="ROM 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2"/>Kakuli omulawo no mebo no omoyo ou uli kwa Jesu Kilesite kame unani liulula ku mulawo no sibi ni lifu. <verse eid="ROM 8:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3"/>Kakuli Nyambe natende eso sina kukwangwiwa ku mulawo wa Mushe, mulibaka no kufokola ku unu. Kame ana atula esibi muunu mu kutuma Mwanaye mulibaka no sibi, woyo ona kwiya mu unu kanyi omukwa wetu no sibi. <verse eid="ROM 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4"/>Nyambe nakutenda ngeeso nji esi silaelelwa mu mulawo wa Mushe siiyatetetwe mwaaci aa aendisiwa ku Mebo kasa mumukwa noun. <verse eid="ROM 8:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5"/>Kakuli awo ayoya mu mukwa nounu kame atwala emihupulo yoo kweyi nounu, kono ao ayoya mu mebo kame atwala emihupulo yoo kweyi no mebo. <verse eid="ROM 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6"/>Kakuli awo ayoya mu mukwa nounu kame ku twala ku lifu, kono awo ayupa eyi no mebo kame ku twala ku omoyo ni kozo. <verse eid="ROM 8:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7"/>Kakuli awo ayupa eyi nounu kame atimbile Nyambe, kakuwana ni mulawo wa Nyambe, mane kaatwese luli. <verse eid="ROM 8:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8"/>Cwale awo aendisiwa muunu katwese oku wabelisa Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 8:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9"/>Kono anyi kamufanene okuyoya muunu, kakuli kame muli mu mebo, mi luli Emebo ya Nyambe kame ili mwaanyi. Omunu yonje nji kakwite Emebo ya Kilesite kaasa waye. <verse eid="ROM 8:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10"/>Kono nji Kilesite kame ali mwaanyi, simba nji etinyutu tenu natifi mulibaka no sibi, Emebo yenu kame iyoya mulibaka no kuluka balubala wa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11"/>Cwale Emebo ya woyo ona ingula Jesu kwaafu nji kame ili mwaanyi, yonyene woyo ona ingula Jesu Kilesite kwaafu mbabi omoyo ku tinyutu tenu eti tifa mu mebo yaye eyi iyakile mwaanyi.<verse eid="ROM 8:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12"/>Cwalehe, abaange, kame tufanena okuyoya kanyi Emebo omo itu ambelela okuyoya, kono kasa okuyoya omo tusingela aaci. <verse eid="ROM 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13"/>Kakuli aba mu yoya mu ku kon̄elela etitakazo no lutu lwenu, mba mufu, kono nji kame mwibaa emisebezi no lutu mulibaka no mebo, mba mu yoyo. <verse eid="ROM 8:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14"/>Kakuli onje awo aendisiwa ku mebo ya Nyambe, ao naana a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15"/>Abo kamwasi tambula Emebo eyo imiingenyeka mu ubika nji mucile, kono kame muna tambula Emebo imi tenda aana a Nyambe, kakuli na mutambula Emebo eyi yang'ula, eyo mwa yonyene aba tulilaa nji, “Abba, Sitetu!” <verse eid="ROM 8:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16"/>Yo kame Emebo eyi ikupakela ni mebo yetu nji kame tuli aana a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17"/>Mi cwale nji kame tuli aana a Nyambe, mba tuli naaci esanda, tulye esanda sa Nyambe ni Kilesite nji kame tuyanda naye nji tuwane ekanya ni yonyene.<verse eid="ROM 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ekanya Eyi Iiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18"/>Kame ninahana nji amayando no ba nako ino kalukele okubapanywa ni kanya eyo saimonahale kwaaci. <verse eid="ROM 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19"/>Kakuli eyumbiwa yonje kame itatelele mu kushukela onene okushotolwa no aana a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 8:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20"/>Kakuli eyo ina ku umbiwa, kame ina ku bekiwa mu puso eino mapwa, ka sa mu ku singa kwayo, kono mu kusinga kwa woyo ona kuibeekamo mu sepo, <verse eid="ROM 8:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:21"/>nji eyumbiwa ni yonyene kame sailukululwe mu ubika no koola nji ibiwe etukuluho no kanya ya aana a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 8:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22"/>Kame tu limukile nji eyumbiwa yonje kame itonga bamweya naaci mi kame iyupa okukola no kuleya ni balelo lino. <verse eid="ROM 8:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23"/>Mi kasa eyumbiwa fela, kono naaci, aa ali omuselo no weeli no mebo naaci kame tutonga me tu tatelele onene okutenda aana, mane ni kuliululwa ku tiyutu tetu. <verse eid="ROM 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24"/>Kakuli mu sepo eyi natu yoyisiwa. Cwale esepo eyo imonahala cwale sebeli kasa sepo, kakuli anyine so sepa eyi amona? <verse eid="ROM 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25"/>Kono aba tu sepa eyi twasimona, kame tu si tatelele onene mu kukoongota.<verse eid="ROM 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26"/>Mu mukwanongeso Emebo no kukena kame itutusa mu kufokola kwetu, kakuli katuyii omo tufanena okulapelela, kono Emebo yonyene kame itu lapelela mu sitongo ni maywi ao ka twesiwa okutaluswa. <verse eid="ROM 8:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27"/>Cwale yonyene woyo otatuba emicima no aanu, kame alimukile emihupulo no mebo kakuli Emebo kame ilemine oku lapelela aanu a Nyambe, okukumanena ni tato ya Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28"/>Kame tu limukile nji einu yonje kame ibelekisana bamweya okulita ouwa kwaawo asinga Nyambe, onyene awo ana isaniwa okwamana mu mulelo waye. <verse eid="ROM 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29"/>Kakuli awo ana kuketa oweli, nakwataba kame okwatenda aa afekile kanyi Mwanaye, nji atende yokame omweeli kwaainaye no kupula. <verse eid="ROM 8:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30"/>Cwale awo ana ku ketiwa, na kwaaisana, mi awo ana kwisaniwa nakwabeeka ano kuluka, mi awo abeekilwe okuluka, naabi ekanya yaye.<verse eid="ROM 8:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elilato lya Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31"/>Cwale ikene sa twaambe kweeyi? Cwale nji Nyambe kame ali kwaaci, anyine sotu lwisa? <verse eid="ROM 8:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32"/>Yonyene woyo wasikukatwa mwanaye luli kono nakutubaye aaci toonje, cwale ngasibine satende, kana katamba okutuba einu yonje ni yonyene? <verse eid="ROM 8:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33"/>Anyine so lita ekatulo okulwisa awo ana ketiwa kwa Nyambe? Yonyene Nyambe onaa tende aa sikuluka! <verse eid="ROM 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34"/>Anyine, cwale so twesa okwaatula? Kasako, kakuli Jesu Kilesite ona kufa, eeni, mane naingulwa kwaafu, woyo oli ku lyoko no silyo lya Nyambe, mi kame a tu lapelela. <verse eid="ROM 8:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35"/>Anyine so tu taba ku lilato lya Kilesite? Nji kame sa kutende amayando, simba oubamba, simba eng'alelwa, simba elishebo, simba okusheeba, simba ekozi, simba omukwale? <verse eid="ROM 8:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36"/>Kanyi omo ku na ku n̄olelwa mu man̄olo nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 8:36">“Mulibaka lyowe kame twibaaiwa eliywaa lyonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 8:36">kame twaliketwa kanyi omukoko ota mukwibaaiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 8:36"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37"/>Kokuulwa, mu inu eyo yonje kame tumatuka niku bitelela mwa yonyene woyo ona kutusinga! <verse eid="ROM 8:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38"/>Kakuli kame ni kolwa nji simba elifu, simba omoyo, simba amangeloi, simba eyi ibusa, simba einu eyi iliko bano, simba einu eyo esiiya, simba amaata, <verse eid="ROM 8:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:39"/>simba beulu, simba kunji, simba esinu sinjili mu yumbiwa yonje, sasitwese okututaba okutunda ku lilato lya Nyambe mwa Jesu Kilesite Ombumu wetu.<verse eid="ROM 8:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9"/>
  <para style="s">Nyambe naanu aye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1"/>Kame naamba eniti mwa Kleste, mi soongo. Elizwalo lyange kame lini paka mu mebo no kukena, <verse eid="ROM 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2"/>kame neenine onene, ni kukola nokwa pumula mu mucima wange <verse eid="ROM 9:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3"/>Kakuli kame ni singe nji, mene luli! ni kutiwe kwa Nyambe ni kutundisiwa kwa Kilesite musibaka no asimukowa wange. <verse eid="ROM 9:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4"/>Onyene luli a Maisilaele, mi okwang'ulwa ni koo, ni kanya, ni ulikani, ni kubiwa omulawo wa Mushe, ni sebelezo, ni ku sepisiwa, <verse eid="ROM 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5"/>onyene kame ali asi mukowa munene omo ina tundu emikowa yonje mane ni Kilesite mwana leiwa muunu, Nyambe woyo oli beulu no inu yonje, alumbekwe okuta oko nokwaabwa! Ameni<verse eid="ROM 9:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6"/>Kono kasa nji esepiso ya Nyambe naikwangwa, Kakuli kasa anu onje aa anatundu ku Isilaeli kame ali Amaisilaele. <verse eid="ROM 9:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7"/>Simba awo ali olusika lwa Abulahama, kasa ana a Nyambe onje, kono kame kunaambiwa nji, “Mboliteliwa olusika mwa Isaka aikulyowe.” <verse eid="ROM 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8"/>Esi kame sitalusa nji kasa aana mu nyama ao ali aana a Nyambe, kono aana a Isaka awo ninakusepisa okame aa aliketiwa nji olusika. <verse eid="ROM 9:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9"/>Kakuli esi sokame sinakwambiwa mu sepiso nji, “Mu nako eyi ifanena kame sani uke, mi Sala kame saikale ni Mwana no mushimani.”<verse eid="ROM 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10"/>Mi kasa eyo feela, kono ni Lambeka ngeso aba anakwikala naana no ambuyu ku mulume mumweya yonyene sitetu Isaka. <verse eid="ROM 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11"/>Abo aana no ambuyu akasi leiwa kale mi kaasi tenda ouwa simba ouyi, nji cwale omulelo wa Nyambe no kuketa utendahale, <verse eid="ROM 9:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 9:12"/>Lambeka nakwambeliwa kwa Nyambe nji, “Omukulu mba sebeleze omwanukana,” <verse eid="ROM 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:13"/>Kanyi omo ku n̄olelwe nji, “Kame nisinga Jakobo, kono kame nitimbile Esau.”<verse eid="ROM 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14"/>Cwale iikene eyo satwaambe? Kana Nyambe wa saluluti? Kokuulwa! <verse eid="ROM 9:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15"/>Kakuli na kwamba kwa Mushe nji, “Kame sanifele amakeke woyo sani fele amakeke, mi kame sani shemube woyo sani shemube.” <verse eid="ROM 9:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16"/>Cwale kasa mulibaka lya eyo a saela omunu simba kweyo atenda, kono kame iimanine feela ba makeke a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 9:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17"/>Kakuli mu eling'olo Nyambe nakwambela Ombumu na mu Engepita nji, “Esi ninaku imekele ni mu libaka linene no kumonisa amaata ange mwa wene nji cwale elitina lyange lyambiwe mu litunga lyonje.” <verse eid="ROM 9:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18"/>Cwale abo, kame ashemuba woyo a singa mi kame atatafalela woyo asinga.<verse eid="ROM 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okutweba ni Makeke a Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19"/>Cwalehe kame so aambe kwa mene, “Ngasibine satunyaziwe kwa Nambe? Kakuli anyine so kana etato ya Nyambe?” <verse eid="ROM 9:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20"/>Kono tiwe anyine wene omunu, aba okanana Nyambe? Kana esiumbiwa iikene sa saambe ku muumbi, “Iikene aba munani tende ngeesi?” <verse eid="ROM 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21"/>Kana omu umbi no tucoo kame akwite etukelo no ku ku tusisa elimaa omwa singila? Ba sin̄omoto si mweya no limaa kame twesa oku umbabo otucoo twiili, eijili nokuwaba einjili no kwakutekeha.<verse eid="ROM 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22"/>Cwalehe nji Nyambe asinge okumonisa okutweba kwaye ni kulimukisa amaata aye, kono sebeli otatelela ba nako no kuleba mane ni kuyanda kwao ana kwaliketa ni kutweba kwao ana kusinga oku sinya sinya. <verse eid="ROM 9:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23"/>Nji Nyambe asinge oku monisa oufumu no kanya yaye mulibaka no makeke, aaci ana kulukisetwa ekanya ba weeli. <verse eid="ROM 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24"/>Bokame abo ana kwisana ka sa ku Majuda feela kono ni kwa simacaba. <verse eid="ROM 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25"/>Kanyi eyo anaamba Nyambe mu buka ya Hosea, aba aamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:25">“Awo ana kutenda nji kasa aanu ange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">mbanaisana ‘anange mi aanu nasiisana aanu ange.’ mbaisaniwa aanu ange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:25">mbanaisana aasingiwa.’<verse eid="ROM 9:25"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26"/>Mi omo Nyambe ana kwamba nji, ‘anyi kamu tendile esicaba sange,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:26">kame saisaniwe nji aana a Nyambe no kuyoya.”<verse eid="ROM 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27"/>Mi Isaya kame aamba kwaanu a Isilaele nji, “Aanu no Isilaele simba aba sa ikale ano kupula kanyi omushekesheke no ba likamba no liwate, Mba ku yoyisiwa ano kwetekela feela <verse eid="ROM 9:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28"/>Kakuli Ombumu kame satende ekatulo yaye anaamba mu litunga, aitende muwangu okwimanenena.” <verse eid="ROM 9:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29"/>Mi kanyi Isaya aba anakwamba nji, “Kambe Ombumu no timpi kasikutu siyela aana, kambe kame tukufekile kanyi Sondoma ni Ngomola.”<verse eid="ROM 9:29"/></para>
  <para style="s">Isilaele ni liywi no kuwaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30"/>Cwale iikene sa twambe? Nji ano macaba awo kaasiku singa okukong'a okuluka nawana, okuluka kutunda mu tumelo, <verse eid="ROM 9:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31"/>Kono aanu no Isilaele awo ana kusuweza omulawo wa Mushe no kuluka kasikuuwana. <verse eid="ROM 9:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32"/>Cwale mu libaka lya iikene? Kakuli ka si kuutenda mu tumelo kono kame anakuutenda mu misebezi no mulawo, kame ana sitatala ba “liwee eli li sitatalisa” <verse eid="ROM 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33"/>Kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">“Kamu mone, kame ni beeka mu Sione eliwee elyo saali sitatalise aanu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 9:33">eliwee elyo salyakwise.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 9:33">Mi woyo yonje so pumena kwa yonyene katamba okwenisiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 9:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1"/>Aanyi akwange, esi nilakaza mu mucima wange mane ni tapelo yange kwa Nyambe ninji aanu ange akayoyisiwe! <verse eid="ROM 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2"/>Kame naapaka nji, kame atukufalelwe eyi ya Nyambe kono kasa muku yupisisa. <verse eid="ROM 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3"/>Kakuli mukwalimuka okuluka kwa Nyambe, mane ni muku saela okuluka koo, kasiku kubeeka kunji no kuluka kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4"/>Kakuli Kleste bokame aba kubwela omulawo wa Mushe, nji omunu yonje woyo opumena amubeeke ono kuluka.<verse eid="ROM 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyoisiwa ni Kwaanu Onje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5"/>Mushe nan̄olo eyi nji, “Omunu woyo okong'elela okuluka oko ku tunda ba mulawo mbayoyo nawo.” <verse eid="ROM 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6"/>Kono okuluka ku suminwe ba tumelo kame kwambiwa nji, “Olese okwamba mu mucima wowe nji, anyine so kambamena ku wilu?” (abo ni ku lita Kilesite banji). <verse eid="ROM 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7"/>Simba nji, “Anyine so shetumukela mu sibaka saano kufa?” (abo, ni kwingula Kilesite kwaafu). <verse eid="ROM 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8"/>Kono iikene esi sambiwa? “Eliywi kame lili beebi ni wene, ba kanwa kowe ni mu mucima wowe” (esi, ni liywi no tumelo elyo tukutaza) <verse eid="ROM 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9"/>Kakuli nji kame wamba ni kanwa kowe nji, Jesu ni Mbumu niku pumena mu mucima wowe nji Nyambe naku mwingula kwaafu, mbuyoisiwa. <verse eid="ROM 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10"/>Kakuli omunu kame apumena ni mucima waye nji abeekiwe uyu no kuluka, mi kame apaka ni kanwa nji ayoisiwe. <verse eid="ROM 10:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11"/>Amang'olo kame aamba nji, “Awo onje apumena kwa yonyene katamba kwenisiwa.” <verse eid="ROM 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12"/>Mihe ka kwaliketiwa nji kame kuli eshutano mukaci no Majuda ni Mangelike, kakuli Ombumu no aanu onje ni mumweya, mi niwakufuma mwao aisana kwa yonyene onje. <verse eid="ROM 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13"/>Kanyi omu aambela aman̄olo nji, “Awo onje aisana ba litina lya Mbumu mbayoisiwa.”<verse eid="ROM 10:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14"/>Kono ngasibine sa isane kwa yonyene woyo kaasipumena? mi ngasibine sa lumele kwa yonyene woyo kasiyupa kale? mi ngasibine sa yupe eliywi oku ulwile osiku kutaza? <verse eid="ROM 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15"/>Mi ngasibine aanu abaka kutaza aka situmiwa? kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji, “Ngasibine awabile amakondo aawo akutaza eliywi no kuwaba!” <verse eid="ROM 10:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16"/>Kono kasa onje ana kuteke eliywi no kuwaba. Kakuli Isaya naamba nji, “Mbumu, anyine ona pumene eyo ana yupu kwaaci?” <verse eid="ROM 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17"/>Cwalehe, etumelo kame itunda ba kuyupa, mi okuyupa kame kwiiya mu ku kutaziwa eyi ya Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 10:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18"/>Kono nisi ibanguta, ninji kasiyupa? Kokuulwa nayupu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:18">“Eliywi lyoo nalihasana mu litunga lyonje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:18">mi amaywi oo nakakeela ku mamaneneno no litunga.”<verse eid="ROM 10:18"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19"/>Kame niibanguta nji, Amaisilaele kaasiyupa? Mushe yono tateka okutambula nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:19">“Mbanikutusisa aano macaba nambulwa tuso okumitenda asimuna, awo kalimukile onyene mane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:19">ni lusika no weelo kame sanimi twebise.”<verse eid="ROM 10:19"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20"/>Mi Isaya sebeli okongota okwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 10:20">“Kame nina waniwa kwawo ana kuulwa oku nisaela,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 10:20">kame nina kumonahaza kwaawo ana kuulwa okwiibanguta eyange.”<verse eid="ROM 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21"/>Kono aba aamba Isilaele nji, “Kame ina olola amaoko ange eliywaa lyonje kwaanu no kwaayupa mi naakana okupumena.”<verse eid="ROM 10:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11"/>
  <para style="s">Amakeke a Nyambe kwaanu a Isilaele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1"/>Kame ni ibanguta, Nyambe na kana aanu aye? Kokuulwa! kakuli mene luli kame nili mwiisilaele, no lusika lwa Abulahama, no mushobo wa Benjamine. <verse eid="ROM 11:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2"/>Nyambe kasi kana aanu aye awo ano kuketela okutunda ku matatekelo. Kamulimukile eling'olo omu lya mbela, omo Eliya omu ana kukumbelela kwa Nyambe kweyi no Isilaele nji, <verse eid="ROM 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3"/>“Mbumu, kame anaibaa anuhi owe, kame ana kwisi etialetale towe, mi time memboci nina siyala, mi kame asaela omoyo wange.” <verse eid="ROM 11:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4"/>Kono siikene ana tambula Nyambe kwa yonyene? Neli nji, “Kame nina kutewele alume noku kwana eikiti mutanu ni yiili (7;000) awo kaasikubama amanwi kwa Baale.” <verse eid="ROM 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5"/>Mi ni mu nako ino kusili aa asi siyalele kwao ana kete Nyambe mulibaka no sishemo saye. <verse eid="ROM 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6"/>Kono nji ni mulibaka no sishemo, abo kasa mu misebezi, kambe ni mu misebezi kambe esishemo kasa sishemo.<verse eid="ROM 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7"/>Abo cwale ni ngasibine? Eso ana kusaela Isilaele kasikusiwana. Anokuketiwa nakusiwana, kono anjili nakukwangwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8"/>Kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji, “Nyambe kame anakwaaba Emebo no mandingwe, ni miyo nokwaamona ni matwi no kwaayupa okulita ba liywaa na balelo lino.” <verse eid="ROM 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9"/>Ni Dabida kame aamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:9">“Mulesele etafule yoo ifutuke elilaba ni katwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:9">esisitataliso ni koto eyi yafanene!<verse eid="ROM 11:9"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10"/>Mulese amiyo oo ailole nji aulwe okumona,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:10">mi emyongo yoo iobame okuta oku nokwaabwa.”<verse eid="ROM 11:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11"/>Cwale kame niibanguta nji, cwale aba ana sitatala naakweelele nji? Kokuulwa! Kono okufosa koo, okuyoisiwa kame kuneyele aasimacaba, nji Amaisilaele abusiwe mukwaafela omuna. <verse eid="ROM 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12"/>Cwale nji okufosa koo kame kuna litele elitunga esifumu, mi oku kwangwa koo kame kuna litele asimacaba esifumu, abo cwale babine sasikume esifumu soo!<verse eid="ROM 11:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okuyoisiwa no Macaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13"/>Cwale kame naamba kwaanyi asimacaba, mi kame ni tumisa omusebezi wange kakuli kame nili omutumiwa no macaba. <verse eid="ROM 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14"/>Kubita nji nitendele anjili aasimushobo wange omuna, kono ni yoyise anjili kwaaonyene <verse eid="ROM 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15"/>Kakuli nji okukaniwa koo kame kutalusa okuusiwa no litunga, okutambulwa koo kame sakutaluse ibine? Kandi kasa kwanyi okwingula aafu!<verse eid="ROM 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16"/>Nji enkwilimba ina kutendiwa esitabelo kwa Nyambe baweli neli omuselo owu no kukena, ni mukoko wonje niwa kukena, mi cwale nji omubisi kame ukenine, ni mitai kame ikenine ngeso. <verse eid="ROM 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17"/>Kono nji emitai injili naicoko, cwale wene esitondo no olibe namunaheng'i, kame ona beekiwa mu sibaka saso okutabela oufumu no sitondo no olibe. <verse eid="ROM 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18"/>Abo olese okukuumuseta emitai eyo. Nji kame okukuumusa, ohupule nji kasa wene ona ongota omubisi, kono omubisi wokame owu ukongota.<verse eid="ROM 11:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19"/>Kame so wambe nji, “Emitai aba ina coko neli nji nibeekiwemo mu sibaka sayo.” <verse eid="ROM 11:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20"/>Eyo ni niti. Kame ina temiwa kakuli kaasiku pumena, mi wene nuimana mu tumelo yowe. Cwale okongote mi olese okukuumusa, kono ocile. <verse eid="ROM 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21"/>Cwale nji Nyambe nakuulwa okusileleza emitai luli no sitondo, ni wene katamba okufela amakeke. <verse eid="ROM 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22"/>Mulemuhe cwale esishemo sa Nyambe ni kutweba kwaye. Okutweba kwao anakwi, ni sishemo sa Nyambe kwawene, nji kame otundamena mu makeke aye nji kasangeso niwene mbutemiwa. <verse eid="ROM 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23"/>Mi nonyene akowe aba kaatwalele mu kupumena koo, kame saa beekiwemo nonyene, kakuli Nyambe kame ali ni maata nokwaabeekamo kame. <verse eid="ROM 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24"/>Kakuli nji wene ona patuliwa kweyo ili nji ya luli no sitondo no olibe, ni kubeekiwa mu mukwa nji kasa wa luli, mu sitondo no olibe silimilwe luli, cwale tunjinga saiusetwe okubeekiwa mo eyi emitai na mumushitu no itondo no olibe.<verse eid="ROM 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amakeke a Nyambe baanu onje</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25"/>Abange, sisingi nji mushwekelwe eniti eyi, kame nisinga nji mulimuke einu no ku bambaba. Outata kame oneyi ba kalulo injili no Isilaele, okubitela epalo no asimacaba sonje aba saiiye kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26"/>Mi cwale Amaisilaele onje mbayoisiwa, kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:26">“Omuliululi kame satunde mu Sione</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:26">kame sa tundise eibi mu lusika lwa Jakobo.<verse eid="ROM 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27"/>Mi ou wosotende oukwamanyinga wange nonyene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:27">Abo sani tundise eibi yoo.”<verse eid="ROM 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28"/>Mulibaka no ku kana eliywi no kuwaba aendisi no Majuda nafutuka eiila ya Nyambe, mulibaka lyenu aanu no macaba. Kono okwaliketa omu ana kwaaketela Nyambe, nafutuka alikani aye mulibaka no ashemi oo no kale. <verse eid="ROM 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29"/>Kakuli etimpo ni kwisana kwa Nyambe eyo kaifutuka. <verse eid="ROM 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30"/>Kanyi aanyi omo muna kuulwela elikute kwa Nyambe, kono bano na muwana esishemo kakuli kame mukwite elikute. <verse eid="ROM 11:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31"/>Cwale kaasikukuteka kwa Nyambe nji amakeke ana monisiwa kwa wene nonyene nji atambule amakeke. <verse eid="ROM 11:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32"/>Kakuli Nyambe nanungu aanu onje no kuulwa elikute, nji aafele amakeke onje.<verse eid="ROM 11:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etumbo kwa Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33"/>Outungi no ufumu ni kushangama ni unangu wa Nyambe! Etikatulo taye kati twesahala okusaisisiwa, mane ni tindila taye kati twesahala okuwaniwa! <verse eid="ROM 11:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34"/>Kanyi omu kuna kung'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 11:34">“Anyine woyo olimukile emihupulo no Mbumu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:34">Anyine woyo sotwesa okumweleza?<verse eid="ROM 11:34"/></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35"/>“Simba nji anyine woyo onabi Nyambe empo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 11:35">nji ausetwe esinjili?”<verse eid="ROM 11:35"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36"/>Kakuli einu yonje kame itunda kwa Yonyene, kame inaiyi mwa Yonyene, mi kame itendelwa Yonyene. Kwa Yonyene kwikale ekanya mu nako ni nako! Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 11:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12"/>
  <para style="s">Oupilo mu Misebezi ya Nyambe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1"/>Aabange, kame ni milapela cwale mu sishemo sa Nyambe mutende etinyutu tenu esitabelo no kuyoya, okukena niku tambulwa kwa Nyambe nji itende okulapela kwenu no mebo. <verse eid="ROM 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2"/>Mulese okukubeeka onene kweyi no litunga, kono mufutulwe mu kumishemuna mukuyupisisa kwenu nji mulemuhe esi singwa kwa Nyambe nji sibine, esi no kuwaba nesi silumelelwa ni kupetahala.<verse eid="ROM 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3"/>Cwale mulibaka no sishemo sina biwi kwa mene kame ninunga omunu yonje mwanyi nji alese okukununeka onene okubita omu ahupulela aakwaye, kono akuhupule wino kweyo imulikana, omunu ni munu mu tumelo ana biwi kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4"/>Kakuli kanyi omu twikalele ni ilama nokupula mu lutu lumweya, mi eilama kaitende omusebezi mumweya, <verse eid="ROM 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5"/>kamekulingeso ni kwaaci naba tuli ano kupula, kame tuli esilama simweya kwa Kilesite mi toonje kame tuna bekiwa bamweya kanyi lutu lumweya. <verse eid="ROM 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6"/>Cwale aba tuli ni timpo eti tishutana, okuta mu sishemo tunabiwi, tuku tusise yoo, nji niunuhi tunuhe okuta mu tumelo yetu. <verse eid="ROM 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7"/>Nji nisebelezo, tubeleke ngeso, nji nikwiiyeta twiiyete ngeso. <verse eid="ROM 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8"/>Nji nikususuweza tususweze ngeeso, woyo oba, abe yo lukuluhile, woyo otwaletela atwaletele wino, woyo otenda etikezo no makeke, atende yo wabelelwe.<verse eid="ROM 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emilao no Lilato</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9"/>Elilato lyuulwe okukutendela. Mutimbe ouyi, mukumalele ouwa. <verse eid="ROM 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10"/>Mu kusinge omunjili ku munjili kanyi omunu ni minaye, mi mukubeeke okumonisa okukutekana. <verse eid="ROM 12:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11"/>Kweyi nouku kataza mulese okufokola, mutukufalelwe mu mebo, mubelekele Ombumu. <verse eid="ROM 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12"/>Mu wabelelwe mu sepo, mukongote mu mayando mi mutundamene mu kulapela. <verse eid="ROM 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13"/>Mutabele aasikupumena ku inu aba aulwile, mutundamene mu kutambula angenda.<verse eid="ROM 12:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14"/>Mufuyole aa amiyandisa, mufuyole mi mulese okukuta. <verse eid="ROM 12:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15"/>Muwabelelwe nawo awabelelwa, mulile nawo alila. <verse eid="ROM 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16"/>Mutende asimucima mumweya anjili ku kwanjili, mulese oukukuumusa kono mu lumele okwikala nawo kaakwite einu, mi mulese oukumona oku shangama.<verse eid="ROM 12:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17"/>Mulese okuusa ouyi ku uyi, kono mutokomele okusinga eino kuwaba mu miyo no aanu onje. <verse eid="ROM 12:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18"/>Nji kame ku twesahala, simba mwaanyi, mu yoisane mu kozo naanu onje. <verse eid="ROM 12:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19"/>Asingiwa, mulese okuusa ouyi mwenyene, kono mube okutweba kwa Nyambe esibaka, kakuli kame kung'olilwe nji, “Okufaniketa ni kwange, time sani usa, kame kwamba Ombumu.” <verse eid="ROM 12:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20"/>Cwale, “Esiila sowe aba siyombile, osibe esino kulya, nji kame sifile elinyotwa, osibe esi no kunwa, kakuli mukutenda ngeso, kame wenisa esiila sowe.” <verse eid="ROM 12:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21"/>Olese oku lumelela ouyi nji okukome, kono okome ouyi ni uwa.<verse eid="ROM 12:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13"/>
  <para style="s">Oku Kuteka Asikubusa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1"/>Cwale omunu yonje aku beeke kunji no maata no ao asikubusa elitunga. Kakuli kakwisa amaata ao kaatundu kwa Nyambe, mi amaata no kuneneba aliko kame ana kusumiwa kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2"/>Cwale abo woyo okana amaata aa kame akana eso sinaketiwa kwa Nyambe, mi ao atenda ngeeso kame saatuliwe. <verse eid="ROM 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3"/>Aa busisi kaacilisa kwao atenda wino, kono kwao atenda eyi nokwiiba. Nji mulese kucila woyo oli mu mubuso, Cwale mutende eyi no kuwaba mi mbamuwana okulumbiwa kwa yonyene, <verse eid="ROM 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4"/>woyo ni mubika wa Nyambe kuuwa wenu. Kono nji kame mutenda eyi no kwiiba mumucile, kakuli amaata aye no kubakisa nia niti, ni mubika wa Nyambe woyo omonisa okubambaba kwa Nyambe kwao asikutenda ouyi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5"/>Abo cwale omunu kame afanena okukong'elela amaata, kono kasa feela mukucila okutweba kwa Nyambe kono kame ni mulibaka no lizwalo.<verse eid="ROM 13:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6"/>Elibaka elyo naanyi kame mutenekanga omutelo, aano mulawo kame abelekela Nyambe abo aba aiyateteta emisebezi yoo. <verse eid="ROM 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7"/>Mwateneke onje einu yoo, muteneke omutelo kwao ufanena, elikute kwao lifanena, mukuteke ao afanena okukutekiwa.<verse eid="ROM 13:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Emisebezi ku munu ni munu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8"/>Mulese kuteula esikoloti no munu konji oku kusinga omunjili ku munjili, kwa woyo osinga omwabaye kame aiyateteta omulawo wa Mushe. <verse eid="ROM 13:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9"/>Etitaelo eto taamba nji, “Mulese okutenda owoozwa, mulese kwiibaa, mulese kwiita, mulese okulakaza einu no akwenu” mane ni titaelo etinjili kame tikuumbele mou omulawo ou wamba nji, “Musinge ao muyakile noo kanyi omu mukusingela mwenyene.” <verse eid="ROM 13:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10"/>Nji kame musinga aa muyakile noo kamutwese okwaatenda ouyi, abo cwale elilato nikwiiya teteta emilao ya Mushe.<verse eid="ROM 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11"/>Kame mufanena okutenda ngeeso kakuli mulimukile nji enako yakeela kale abo nji mwinguke batulo. Abo enako eyo satuyoyisiwe sebeli ili beebi bano okubita omo ina kwikalelanga baweli aba tuna kutateka oku pumena. <verse eid="ROM 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12"/>Ousiku wata kale kule, mi cwale omunjii sebeli uli netu. Abo cwale tutundise emisebezi no uwi mi tukufuke eilwiso tuku tusisanga mu liseli. <verse eid="ROM 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13"/>Tweende wino kanyi aanu aa ayoya mu nako no munji, kasa mukulya ouyi, simba oundalabangwana, eyi no woozwa simba eyi no uhule, simba eting'ananyi ni muna. <verse eid="ROM 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14"/>Kono mukufuke Mbumu Jesu Kilesite mi mulese okutenda etindila no lutu okwiiyateteta etitakazo talo.<verse eid="ROM 13:14"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14"/>
  <para style="s">Olese Okwatula Omukowe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1"/>Kanyi ku munu noku kesheba mu tumelo, atambuliwe, kono mulese okukanana naye oku kumanena ni mihupulo yaye. <verse eid="ROM 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2"/>Omunu munjili kame apumena nji alye eilya yonje, abo woyo no kukesheba kame alya fela emiloho. <verse eid="ROM 14:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3"/>Woyo olya esilya sonje alese okunyaza woyo no kwaailya, mi woyo no kwaailya alese okwatula woyo oilya, kakuli natambuliwa kwa Nyambe ni yonyene. <verse eid="ROM 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4"/>Tiwe anyine nji watule omubika no mukowe? Naba sa ongole simba okukwa nitaba no molyaye. Kono mba ongola, kakuli omolyaye mbamuongota.<verse eid="ROM 14:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5"/>Omunu munjili kame aaliketa eliywaa limweya nji nilyautokwa okubita amaywaa anjili, mi omunjili omunu kame aaliketa nji onje kame alikanelela. Mulese omunu yonje atende esi akolwa wino mu muhupulo waye. <verse eid="ROM 14:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6"/>Woyo omamela eliywaa, kame alimamela mukukuteka Ombumu. Woyo olya esilya sonje, kame akuteka Ombumu, kakuli kame akutumela kwa Nyambe, mi woyo no kwaalya eilya yonje, kame atenda mukukuteka Ombumu nuukutumela kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7"/>Kakwisa kwaaci woyo okuyoyela yonyene fela, mi kakwisa woyo okufela yonyene fela. <verse eid="ROM 14:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8"/>Cwale aba tuyoya kame tuyoyela kwa Mbumu, mi aba tufa, kame tufela kwa Mbumu. Mi cwale, aba tufa naaba tuyoya, kame tuli kwa Mbumu. <verse eid="ROM 14:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9"/>Kakuli Kilesite aba ana kufa, mi kame sebeli oyoya neli nji atende Ombumu no asikufa naa ayoya. <verse eid="ROM 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10"/>Cwale iikene aba watula omwabowe? Simba wene, iikene aba onyaza omwabowe? Kakuli toonje kame satuimekwe balubala no situlo sa Nyambe no katulo. <verse eid="ROM 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11"/>Kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 14:11">“Luli aba ni yoya, kame kwamba Ombumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">munu yonje kame sakubame balubala wange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 14:11">mi omunu yonje kame sa lumbeke Nyambe.”<verse eid="ROM 14:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12"/>Abakulingeso, omunu yonje kame sabe ekalabo yaye kweyi anatende kwa Nyambe.<verse eid="ROM 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tulese Okukwisa omunjili ku munjili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13"/>Cwale tulese okwatula akwetu kame. Kono onene muhupule nji omunu alese okubeekela omwabaye esi simukwisa, simba esi simu sitatalisa. <verse eid="ROM 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14"/>Niyii, mi kame nikolwa mwa Mbumu Jesu nji kakwisa esinu siku silafaza sonyene, kono omunu aba aaliketa esinu nji sa kusilafala, abohe esinu eso kame sisilafalile kwa yonyene. <verse eid="ROM 14:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15"/>Cwale nji minowe simba mukulowe kame omwenisa ba sinu eso olya, abo kwende mu lilato. Olese okulumeleza eso olya nji sisinye omukowe woyo ana kufeliwa kwa Jesu. <verse eid="ROM 14:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16"/>Cwale mulese oku lumelela ouwa wenu okwambiwa nji kwiiba, <verse eid="ROM 14:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17"/>Kakuli omubuso wa Nyambe kasa wakulya ni kunwa kono okuluka ni kozo ni kuwabelelwa mu mebo no kukena. <verse eid="ROM 14:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18"/>Kakuli woyo osebeleza Kilesite kame awabelisa Nyambe mi kame alumelelwa kwaanu.<verse eid="ROM 14:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19"/>Abohe tu tundamene kweyi ilita ekozo, neyi satu yakisane nayo. <verse eid="ROM 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20"/>Olese okusinya omusebezi wa Nyambe mulibaka no silya sowe no kwakena. Sinu sonje kame sikenine, kono ouyi ni munu aba alya esilya eso sisitatalisa omukwaye. <verse eid="ROM 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21"/>Ouwa ninji mulese okulya enyama simba okunwa ewaine, simba okutenda esinu eso si sitatalisa minowe. <verse eid="ROM 14:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22"/>Etumelo eyo oli nayo, oiteule mukaci kowe ni Nyambe. Embuyoti niya woyo nambulwa elibaka no kukwatula yonyene kweeyo analemuha. <verse eid="ROM 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23"/>Kono woyo obilaela kame anyaziwa nji kame alya, kakulli katende mu tumelo. Kakuli esinu sonje eso sasitendiwa mu tumelo, ni sibi.<verse eid="ROM 14:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15"/>
  <para style="s">Muwabetwe aakwenu kasa okukuwabetwa Mwemboci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1"/>Aaci no kongola mu tumelo kame tufanena okutusa nawo noku fokola oku shimba emishimbo yoo. Katufanene okuku wabetwa twemboci. <verse eid="ROM 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2"/>Cwale omunjili ni munjili kwaaci awabetwe woyo ayakile naye kuuwa woo, okwaa kulisa mu tumelo yoo. <verse eid="ROM 15:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3"/>Kakuli simba Kilesite kasikukuwabetwa yomboci, kono kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji, “Okwangoliwa kwaao amyangolanga kwaiya kale kwa mene.” <verse eid="ROM 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4"/>Eyo yonje ina kung'oliwa kunyima kame ina kung'oliwa mu mukwa no kulaela aci, nji mukoongoteta ni muku susueziwa mu liywii mbatu wana esepo. <verse eid="ROM 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5"/>Cwale Nyambe no kongoteta ni susuwezo amibe okuyoya wino mukaci kenu omunjili ku munjili bamweya ni Kilesite Jesu, <verse eid="ROM 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6"/>nji bamweya ni liywi limweya mutwese oku kanyisa Nyambe yonyene sitaye Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 15:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Amaywi no kuwaba kwao no macaba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7"/>Abo cwale mutambule omunjili ku munjili kanyi omo ana kumitambulela Kilesite mu kanya ya Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 15:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8"/>Abo kame nimyambela nji Kilesite nakutenda omubika kwao ana kuta ku mupato oku monisa eniti ya Nyambe, okuongoteta esepiso inakubiwa kwaa shemi oo. <verse eid="ROM 15:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9"/>Mi abo nji aano macaba akanyise Nyambe ku sishemo kumusa waye, kanyi omo kung'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:9">“Abo cwale mbani lumbeke yonyene mukaci no asimacaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:9">Mbaniimbi okulumbeka elitina lyowe.”<verse eid="ROM 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10"/>Mi kame nakukwambiwa nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:10">“Muwabelelwe aano macaba onje naanu aye!”<verse eid="ROM 15:10"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11"/>mi kame,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:11">“Mulumbeke Mbumu, aano macaba onje,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:11">mi mulese aanu onje amulumbeke!”<verse eid="ROM 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12"/>mi kame okutunda abo, Isaya nakwamba nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:12">“Emibisi ya Jese mbaimene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">Mbainguka okubusa aano macaba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:12">mi asimacaba mbaabeke esepo yoo kwayonyene.”<verse eid="ROM 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13"/>Cwale Nyambe no sepo, amiiyate okuwabelelwa mukwiyala ni kozo muku pumena kwenu, nji cwale mulibaka no mata no Mebo no kukena mwiyale esepo inene.<verse eid="ROM 15:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Elibaka lya Paulusi mukung'ola ngeeso mukuzwafa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14"/>Meene luli kame naniyupisisa kwaanyi, aabange, nji anyi kame mwiyalile ouwa ni tingana tonje mi kame mutwesa okuku laela omunjili ku munjili. <verse eid="ROM 15:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15"/>Kono banako injili kame ninaku ming'olela mukuzwafa mumukwa no kumi pulukisa, mulibaka no sishemo sinakubiwa kwa mene okutunda kwa Nyambe, <verse eid="ROM 15:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16"/>okutenda omubika wa Kilesite Jesu kwaa no macaba mu situlo nou pulisita no Liywi no kuwaba lya Nyambe, nji cwale etinubu no ao asimacaba atwese oku tambuliwa ni kenisiwa ku Mebo no kukena. <verse eid="ROM 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17"/>Mwa Kilesite Jesu, kame nikwite elibaka no oukukuhusa ku misebezi yange kwa Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18"/>Kakuli kanitamba okwingena okwamba nambulwa eso anawana Kilesite mwa mene muku endisa aano macaba nji akong'elele Nyambe mulibaka lyaeyo ninaamba neyo nitenda. <verse eid="ROM 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19"/>Mu maata no timakazo ni yambo no kukomokisa, mu maata no Mebo nokukena, nji cwale okutunda ku Njelusalema mane ni kutunda musibaka soonje no Ililiko kame nina kutaza mukwiyala eliywi lya Kilesite. <verse eid="ROM 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20"/>Mane ni kwiitenda etakazo yange okukutaza eliywi oko kasikulimukiwa kale Jesu, nji cwale nilese okuyaka abo ana tateke omukwange okuyaka. <verse eid="ROM 15:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21"/>Kono kanyi omo kumg'olelwe nji,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ROM 15:21">“Mbamono woyo kasi kwambeliwa kale eyaye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ROM 15:21">mi mbaa yupisisa woyo kasi kwambeliwa kale eyaye.”<verse eid="ROM 15:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Omulelo wa Paulusi no kupotela ku Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22"/>Eli elibaka elyo enako yonje kame nina ku kani siwangwa okwiiya kwaanyi. <verse eid="ROM 15:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23"/>Kono bano kumona nji sikwite esibaka no kubelekela muno muti tolopo, mi ba myaka no kupula kame ninyolelwe okwiiya kwaanyi, <verse eid="ROM 15:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24"/>kame nisepile nji mbani mimono aba sanibite okuta ku Sipaini, mane nji munituse mu musipili wange kuya, munyima no oku kolwesisa oku nikong'a kwenu kanyonyo. <verse eid="ROM 15:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25"/>Kono bano kame nikatile ku Jelusalema mu musebezi waanu a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 15:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26"/>Kakuli asi Mesodoniya ni Akaya naawabelelwa okutundisa eyi no kuba kwaashebile mukaci kaanu a Nyambe ku Jelusalema. <verse eid="ROM 15:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27"/>Kame anakuwabelwa okutenda ngeeso mi niti luli kameli ni sikoloti kwa onyene, kakuli nji aano macaba naiyi mukukutabela kweyo no timbuyoti too no mebo, kame afanena ngeeso okwatusa mwibelekiso no timbuyoti. <verse eid="ROM 15:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28"/>Cwale abo abasa ni mane eyi mi naaba kale eyo ina litiwa, mbaniekeze okuta mu musipili wange ku Sipanishi <verse eid="ROM 15:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29"/>Mi ni limukile nji aba saniiye kwaanyi mbaniiyi meni iyalile etimbuyoti ta Kilesite.<verse eid="ROM 15:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30"/>Kame ni kumbela kwanyi aabange, mulibaka lya Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite mane ni mulibaka no lilato no Mebo, mu nilwele naanyi bamweya mu milapelo mulibaka lyange kwa Nyambe, <verse eid="ROM 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31"/>nji niikale wino kwao no kwa pumena mu Judeya mane nji omusebezi wange mu Njelusalema upumeniwe kwaanu a Nyambe. <verse eid="ROM 15:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32"/>Nji cwale mukusinga kwa Nyambe ni twese okwiiya kwanyi mukuwabelelwa nji mane niiye nitusiwe mukukuwana kwetu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33"/>Nyambe no kozo aikale nanyi monje. Ameni<verse eid="ROM 15:33"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16"/>
  <para style="s">Okulumelisa kwange</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1"/>Kame ni limukisa kwaanyi mandetu Febe ondikoni mu Ndoo ya Nyambe ya Senkiliya <verse eid="ROM 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2"/>nji mu mutambule mwa Mbumu kanyi aanu a Nyambe, mane nikumuba etuso yonje eyo sasaele okutunda kwaanyi, Kakuli nakwikalanga omutusi kwaanu no kupula mane ni kwamene luli.<verse eid="ROM 16:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3"/>Oasikupumenase Pulisika ni Akwila aakwange ni beleka noo mwa Kileste Jesu, <verse eid="ROM 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4"/>awo ano ku tombola omoyo woo mulibaka lyange. Kame ni kutumela onene kwa yonyene mane kasa meene feela kono ni tikeleke tao aa no macaba tonyene. <verse eid="ROM 16:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5"/>Oasikupumenase Endoo ya Nyambe eyo ikuwanenanga mu ndoo yoo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Oasikupumenase omusingiwa wange Epainetasi woyo neli omutamuno no weli okupumena mwa Kilesite mutolopo ya Asiya. <verse eid="ROM 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6"/>Oasikupumenase Maliya kame woyo ona kubeleka mukongola mukaci kenu. <verse eid="ROM 16:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7"/>Oasikupumenase Andilonikasi ni Njuniyasi aakwange ni mapanditi nina kwikalanga noo mu tolongo, ni alume no kukutekeha mukaci no atumiwa, mi kame ana kwikala kwa Kilesite oweli kwa mene.<verse eid="ROM 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8"/>Muasikupumenase Ampuliyatasi omusingiwa wange mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9"/>Muasikupumenase Ambanasi omwabetu mu musebezi mwa Kilesite ni musingiwa wange Sitakisi <verse eid="ROM 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10"/>Muasikupumenase Apele woyo ona lumelelwe mwa Kilesite. Muasikupumenase ao awaniwa mulusika lwa Alisitobulu <verse eid="ROM 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11"/>Muasikupumenase Helondiyani omukwange Munjunda. awo awaniwa mu lusika lwa Nasiso. Muasikupumenase awo ali mwa Mbumu.<verse eid="ROM 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12"/>Muasikupumenase Tilaifaena ni Tilaifosa, ao abeleki mwa Mbumu, muasikupumenase musingiwa no mu Pesisi woyo onabeleke mu kongola mwa Mbumu. <verse eid="ROM 16:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13"/>Muasikupumenase Lufusi woyo ona ketiwa no kongola mwa Mbumu mane nainawaye naamandi. <verse eid="ROM 16:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14"/>Muasikupumenase Asinkilitasi Felengoni Hemusi, Patolobasi, Hemasi mane ni asingiwa ao ali noo. <verse eid="ROM 16:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15"/>Oasikupumenase Filolongasi ni Njuliya mane ni Neliyasi ni mandaye ni Olimpasi mane ni aanu a Nyambe onje ao ali noo. <verse eid="ROM 16:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16"/>Muasikupumenase omunjili ku munjili mu ukutubeta no kukena. Mi Etikeleke tonje ta Kilesite kame timi keeta.<verse eid="ROM 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Etitaelo no mamaneneno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17"/>cwale abange kame ni mikumbela nji mumamele ao atenda etifapano ni utata mu kulwisa etuto eyo munaiyetiwa, mwaa tokomele. <verse eid="ROM 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18"/>Kakuli aanu no ngeso kaa belekele Ombumu Kilesite kono kame abelekela amapumo oo feela, mi mu maywi ayupisa oku mamata ni kushembashemba kame akelusa emicima no awo asaela okuyupisisa. <verse eid="ROM 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19"/>Ba nako ino okupumena kwenu kame kulimukilwe kwaanu onje, kuti cwale niwabelelwe, kono kame ni singa nji mwikale aano kushangama kweyi no kuwaba mi mu tende ano kweluba kweyi no kwiiba <verse eid="ROM 16:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20"/>Cwale Nyambe omunyaa kozo mba colwele Satani kunji no makondo enu. Esishemo sa Mbumu wetu Jesu siikale naanyi.<verse eid="ROM 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21"/>Timoteya omukwange ni beleka naye kame amikeeta, mane ni Lusiyasi ni Njasoni, ni Sosipatele akwaange ni beleka noo kame amikeeta<verse eid="ROM 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22"/>Meene Tetiyasi omung'oli no ling'olo kame ni mikeeta mwa Mbumu.<verse eid="ROM 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23"/>Ngayusi omutambuli wange nou no keleke yonje kame amikeeta. Elasitasi omu babaleli no mali no muleneng'i kame amikeeta, ni Kwatasi omwabetu kame amikeeta. <verse eid="ROM 16:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24"/>Esishemo sa Mbumu wetu Jesu Kilesite siikale naanyi moonje. Ameni.<verse eid="ROM 16:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Okumanenena emilapelo no milumbeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25"/>Cwale bano kwawoyo otwesa okumyongota oku kumanena ni liywi lyange ni tikutazo ta Jesu Kilesite mane niku kumanena ni sinulo no kunutu no niti eyo inakushweekiwa ba nako no kuleba nakunyima.<verse eid="ROM 16:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26"/>Kono cwale eniti nailimukisiwa mi cwale mwaang'oli no aanuhi a Nyambe nailimukiswa kwaa simacaba onje, okwamana ni taelo ya Nyambe no nako yonje, okulita elikute no tumelo. <verse eid="ROM 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27"/>Kwa Nyambe yonyene feela no kushangama, mwa Jesu Kilesite kwikale ekanya no kwaabwa! Ameni<verse eid="ROM 16:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 16"/>
</usx>
